  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>The Corondexx VES-700 Pulse Rifle is favored by smugglers, bounty hunters, and other outlaws for use on Starships and in urban environments where they are likely to be cornered. Unlike normal Blaster Weapons, a Pulse Rifle targets all targets within a 6-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cone\">Cone</a> as an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>. </p><p>When you make an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;with a Pulse Rifle, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>&nbsp;of every target in the 6-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cone\">Cone</a>. Creatures you hit take full damage, and creatures you miss take half damage. A target with the&nbsp;<b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b>&nbsp;Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses. </p><p>A Pulse Rifle requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 5 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be replaced. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p>",
